# Senseless

> Senseless is a UK brand of topical numbing preparations formulated for aesthetic and cosmetic procedures. The range is organised as a system — three strengths across three formats, plus an aftercare cleanser — so each product can be matched to the treatment, the area being worked on, and individual sensitivity. Senseless is a cosmetic product, not a medicine.

## The Senseless System
The Senseless System is the brand's framework for choosing a product: match the strength tier (Clinical, Advanced, Professional) and the format (cream, gel, spray) to the procedure and the area, on a practitioner's guidance.
- The Senseless System: {{ shop.url }}/pages/the-senseless-system

