## Trust & safety
- Senseless is a cosmetic product, formulated in the United Kingdom. It is not a medicine.
- Every product is supported by a Cosmetic Product Safety Report (CPSR) and assessed under the UK Cosmetic Products Regulation.
- Numbing reduces discomfort rather than removing it. Always follow the product instructions and your practitioner's guidance.

